    "streamingModels": "Each recording played into /v1/realtime at real speed in 80 ms blocks; an utterance's words are those arriving before the next utterance starts (at most 5 s after it ends); latency is from its end to its last word.",
    "wholeUtteranceModels": "Each utterance sent alone to POST /v1/audio/transcriptions as soon as it ends; latency is the request time. One utterance is sent untimed first to warm the model up."
